# Contributing

Refer to the [Ansible community guide](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/devel/community/index.html).

## Getting Starting with Development

### Requirement

- RHEL Environment (or whatever suits but below package have to be changed)
- [Docker](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/rhel/)
- Below packages

```bash
dnf install python3.12
python3.12 -m venv custom-venv
source custom-venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
pip3 install ansible-dev-tools
pip3 install molecule-plugins[docker]
sudo dnf install -y rsync
# For pre-commit to work, for RHEL
dnf install libatomic -y
pip install pre-commit && pre-commit install
```

- OR just install the test-requirements.txt and test-requirments.yml
